  "solution": {
    "text": "Using quotient&nbsp;rule, we get,<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><menclose notation=\"left bottom\"><mn>2</mn></menclose></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>",
